OL,3,GNEWSACouncil agrees to run community
OL,4,Ahub
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Council will run
OL,7,FCatterick Garrison's new community hub
OL,8,Fitself after councillors agreed an
OL,9,Foperating model for the facility.
OL,11,FKnow as the Community and Enterprise
OL,12,FBuilding, the facility off Shute Road
OL,13,Fforms a part of a wider regeneration
OL,14,Fproject which secured government
OL,15,FLevelling Up funding in 2023 and is due
OL,16,Fto open next February.
OL,18,FRunning the building in-house is
OL,19,Fexpected to cost the council an average
OL,20,Fof around #233,000 a year over ten
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
